  lines:
  - text: These ruins... my friend was last seen somewhere around here. I have to
      find them.
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
  - text: This desert is full of dangers. Creatures lurk in every shadow — I need
      to stay sharp.
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Fight through, find the way back to the open world. I am not leaving without
      them.
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
